  "description": "Wannabe writer Park Dae-gu knows how to coast through life. With no real job or ambition, he is perfectly content sitting at home and mooching off his wife. When he and his wife move into a new apartment building with a funny name, Dae-gu is ready to get up-close and personal with the hot married woman living next-door. And while having an affair with one of your neighbors is not the best idea, no one said Dae-gu was going to have just one. What piping hot trouble is Dae-gu going to brew, and will his wife catch a whiff of the naughtiness?\n\n(Source: Lezhin X)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue.*",
